</div></div><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><ul>
<li>Zero commission for trading stocks and ETFs.</li>
<li>Regulatory agencies may charge fees that are passed to the investor. <a href="/legal/equities">Learn more here.</a></li>
</ul>
</div></div><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p><sup>*Currently available in the U.S. only</sup></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative min-w-full"><button id="xstocks" type="button" aria-controls="content-xstocks" aria-expanded="false" class="bg-ds-accordion focus-visible:rounded-ds-2 focus:outline-ds-accordion outline-offset-ds-accordion w-full cursor-pointer border-0 py-0 text-start focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed ps-0 hover:bg-ds-accordion-hover group"><div class="py-ds-5 flex w-full items-center shadow-ds-accordion"><div class="text-ds-body1 text-ds-accordion-primary group-hover:text-ds-accordion-hover" data-testid="title">xStocks</div><div class="ps-ds-7 ms-auto flex flex-shrink-0 items-center" data-testid="chevron-down"><span class="flex origin-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0 w-ds-icon-md h-ds-icon-md" name="ChevronDownSmall"><path d="M7.5 9.98291L11.2045 13.6874C11.6438 14.1268 12.3562 14.1268 12.7955 13.6874L16.5 9.98291" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="fill-transparent stroke-ds-icon-dimmed"></path></svg></span></div></div></button><div id="content-xstocks" aria-labelledby="xstocks" data-testid="content-xstocks" style="display:grid" class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden min-h-0 opacity-[0] grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pb-4"><div class="space-y-6 pb-8 pt-2 [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:mx-auto [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:w-full [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:max-w-[var(--article-max-width)]"><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><ul>
<li><strong> </strong>There are no trading fees when purchasing xStocks with USDG or USD on Kraken.</li>
<li>The standard 1% instant buy/sell trading fee applies when purchasing xStocks using other assets.</li>
<li>To lock in a price, a spread may be included in the asset price for each transaction.</li>
</ul>
</div></div><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p><sup>*Availability can be <a href="https://support.kraken.com/articles/xstocks-availability"><u>found here</u></a>. If xStocks is not showing as an option on your account, you may not be eligible.</sup></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative min-w-full"><button id="perps" type="button" aria-controls="content-perps" aria-expanded="false" class="bg-ds-accordion focus-visible:rounded-ds-2 focus:outline-ds-accordion outline-offset-ds-accordion w-full cursor-pointer border-0 py-0 text-start focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed ps-0 hover:bg-ds-accordion-hover group"><div class="py-ds-5 flex w-full items-center shadow-ds-accordion"><div class="text-ds-body1 text-ds-accordion-primary group-hover:text-ds-accordion-hover" data-testid="title">Perps</div><div class="ps-ds-7 ms-auto flex flex-shrink-0 items-center" data-testid="chevron-down"><span class="flex origin-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0 w-ds-icon-md h-ds-icon-md" name="ChevronDownSmall"><path d="M7.5 9.98291L11.2045 13.6874C11.6438 14.1268 12.3562 14.1268 12.7955 13.6874L16.5 9.98291" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="fill-transparent stroke-ds-icon-dimmed"></path></svg></span></div></div></button><div id="content-perps" aria-labelledby="perps" data-testid="content-perps" style="display:grid" class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden min-h-0 opacity-[0] grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pb-4"><div class="space-y-6 pb-8 pt-2 [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:mx-auto [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:w-full [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:max-w-[var(--article-max-width)]"><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p>A simple, flexible way to trade on where you think prices are headed on — without needing to own the underlying asset.</p>
</div></div><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><ul>
<li>A 0.25% fee is applied to the notional value of the trade to open the position.</li>
<li>A 0.25% fee is applied to the closed notional value of the trade to close the position.</li>
</ul>
</div></div><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p><sup>*Currently available in certain geos</sup></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full" style="box-shadow:var(--box-shadow-ds-accordion, inset 0 1px 0 0 #686b821f)"></div></div></div><div class="pt-5 lg:pb-4 lg:pt-7"><div><a class="text-ds-button-primary-high hover:text-ds-button-primary-high-hover active:bg-ds-button-primary-high-active bg-ds-button-primary-high-gradient hover:bg-ds-button-primary-high-gradient-hover bg-ds-button-primary-high hover:bg-ds-button-primary-high-hover rounded-ds-button-xl focus-visible:outline-offset-ds-button relative box-border border-0 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:pointer-events-none cursor-pointer outline-ds-button ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0 p-ds-button-xl inline-block whitespace-nowrap no-underline text-ds-button-xl" href="/sign-up" tabindex="0" data-ds-component="Button" data-ds-part="root" data-ds-tone="primary" data-ds-emphasis="high" data-ds-size="xl"><span class="flex items-center justify-center gap-ds-button-xl"><span>Get started with Kraken</span></span></a></div></div><div class="pt-14 lg:pt-20"><div id="fd0-kraken-pro" style="--header-height:0px" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+5rem)] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+2rem)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="kraken-image-svg max-h-8 max-w-8"><img src="https://assets-cms.kraken.com/images/51n36hrp/facade/00d9685fa4627cc0abd8a2957e8efcfdffbbc2dc-1024x1024.svg" class="kraken-image-svg" alt="Kraken Pro" loading="lazy"/></span><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-heading3 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><h2 class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic 