lex-1 flex-col gap-ds-notification-vertical-stacked"><div class="flex flex-col"><span id="«R1atecuqqH1»" class="text-ds-notification-text-lg text-ds-notification-subtitle-positive"><div class="[&amp;_em]:italic hover:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-textlink-hover-positive [&amp;_a]:text-ds-notification-subtitle-positive"><p>Kraken has recently introduced Cross-platform fee tiers, read <a target="_blank" href="/features/fee-schedule#cross-platform-fee-tiers">here</a> for details.</p><p><br/></p><p>You can also check out our <a target="_blank" href="https://support.kraken.com/articles/cross-platform-fee-tier-changes">support article</a> which contains additional information.</p></div></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pt-8 lg:pt-10"><div class="
