  [&amp;_button[aria-controls^=&#x27;content-&#x27;]]:!relative"><div class="ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="relative min-w-full"><button id="cross-platform-fee-tiers" type="button" aria-controls="content-cross-platform-fee-tiers" aria-expanded="false" class="bg-ds-accordion focus-visible:rounded-ds-2 focus:outline-ds-accordion outline-offset-ds-accordion w-full cursor-pointer border-0 py-0 text-start focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed ps-0 hover:bg-ds-accordion-hover group"><div class="py-ds-5 flex w-full items-center shadow-ds-accordion"><div class="text-ds-body1 text-ds-accordion-primary group-hover:text-ds-accordion-hover" data-testid="title">Cross-platform Fee Tiers</div><div class="ps-ds-7 ms-auto flex flex-shrink-0 items-center" data-testid="chevron-down"><span class="flex origin-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0 w-ds-icon-md h-ds-icon-md" name="ChevronDownSmall"><path d="M7.5 9.98291L11.2045 13.6874C11.6438 14.1268 12.3562 14.1268 12.7955 13.6874L16.5 9.98291" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="fill-transparent stroke-ds-icon-dimmed"></path></svg></span></div></div></button><div id="content-cross-platform-fee-tiers" aria-labelledby="cross-platform-fee-tiers" data-testid="content-cross-platform-fee-tiers" style="display:grid" class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden min-h-0 opacity-[0] grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pb-4"><div class="space-y-6 pb-8 pt-2 [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:mx-auto [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:w-full [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:max-w-[var(--article-max-width)]"><div id="334-how-your-tier-is-determined" style="--header-height:0px" class="space-y-2 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+5rem)] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+2rem)]"><div class="flex items-center"><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-heading4 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><h3 class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+5rem)] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+2rem)] flex-1">How your tier is determined</h3></div></div><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p>Previously, your tier on each product was based solely on your trading volume in that product. Going forward, your tier is based on the <strong>best of</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>spot trading volume</strong></p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Assets on Platform (AoP)</strong></p></li></ul><p>The measure that qualifies you for the highest tier applies. Holding assets on Kraken can now qualify you for lower trading fees, the more you hold, the lower your rate could be. If more than one measure qualifies you for the same tier, your rates remain unchanged, qualifying through multiple measures at the same tier does not provide additional benefits.</p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://support.kraken.com/articles/cross-platform-fee-tier-changes"><em>More information about cross-platform fee tiers</em></a></p><span style="font-size:0.75em">Scroll table to the right to view percentages</span></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-x-auto [&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_a]:no-underline hover:[&amp;_a]:underline"><table class="w-full text-start"><thead class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700 min-h-[undefinedpx]"><tr class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700"><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Tier</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><p>Spot 30-Day Vol (USD) <strong>OR</strong></p></span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">AoP (USD)</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><p>Maker (%)</p></span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><p>Taker (%)</p></span></th></tr></thead><tbody class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700 border-b-ds-divider-high"><tr class="border-b last:border-b-0 !border-ds-divider-high"><td id="table-cell-525fdc8edfc3-0" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top [&amp;_[data-pt]]:!m-0"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"></span>Tier 1</td><td id="table-cell-525fdc8edfc3-1" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top [&amp;_[data-pt]]:!m-0"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"></span>$0+</td><td id="table-cell-525fdc8edfc3-2" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top [&amp;_[data-pt]]:!m-0"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0