v class="ps-ds-7 ms-auto flex flex-shrink-0 items-center" data-testid="chevron-down"><span class="flex origin-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0 w-ds-icon-md h-ds-icon-md" name="ChevronDownSmall"><path d="M7.5 9.98291L11.2045 13.6874C11.6438 14.1268 12.3562 14.1268 12.7955 13.6874L16.5 9.98291" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="fill-transparent stroke-ds-icon-dimmed"></path></svg></span></div></div></button><div id="content-spot-crypto" aria-labelledby="spot-crypto" data-testid="content-spot-crypto" style="display:grid" class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden min-h-0 opacity-[0] grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pb-4"><div class="space-y-6 pb-8 pt-2 [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:mx-auto [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:w-full [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:max-w-[var(--article-max-width)]"><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p>Kraken uses a maker-taker fee tier system with volume incentives based on your spot volume and your assets on platform (AoP) in the past 30 days.*</p><p>Our fee tiers are built to reward traders regardless of which product of the Kraken platform they use, thus driving maximum liquidity.</p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://support.kraken.com/articles/cross-platform-fee-tier-changes"><em>More information about cross-platform fee tiers</em></a></p><p>Certain services, including Telegram chat trading, use request-for-quote pricing. For these trades, the quoted price is all-inclusive and already reflects Kraken&#x27;s spread and fees.</p><p><sup>*Volume generated with Instant Buy does not count towards your 30 day volume incentives.</sup></p><p><span>Scroll table to the right to view percentages</span></p></div></div><div class="relative overflow-x-auto [&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_a]:no-underline hover:[&amp;_a]:underline"><table class="w-full text-start"><thead class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700 min-h-[undefinedpx]"><tr class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700"><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Tier</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><p>Spot 30-Day Vol (USD) <strong>OR</strong></p></span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primar