&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p><sup>*Fees may be inaccurate if you&#x27;re using a VPN.</sup></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative min-w-full"><button id="spot-maker-rebate" type="button" aria-controls="content-spot-maker-rebate" aria-expanded="false" class="bg-ds-accordion focus-visible:rounded-ds-2 focus:outline-ds-accordion outline-offset-ds-accordion w-full cursor-pointer border-0 py-0 text-start focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed ps-0 hover:bg-ds-accordion-hover group"><div class="py-ds-5 flex w-full items-center shadow-ds-accordion"><div class="text-ds-body1 text-ds-accordion-primary group-hover:text-ds-accordion-hover" data-testid="title">Spot Maker Rebate</div><div class="ps-ds-7 ms-auto flex flex-shrink-0 items-center" data-testid="chevron-down"><span class="flex origin-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0 w-ds-icon-md h-ds-icon-md" name="ChevronDownSmall"><path d="M7.5 9.98291L11.2045 13.6874C11.6438 14.1268 12.3562 14.1268 12.7955 13.6874L16.5 9.98291" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="fill-transparent stroke-ds-icon-dimmed"></path></svg></span></div></div></button><div id="content-spot-maker-rebate" aria-labelledby="spot-maker-rebate" data-testid="content-spot-maker-rebate" style="display:grid" class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden min-h-0 opacity-[0] grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pb-4"><div class="space-y-6 pb-8 pt-2 [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:mx-auto [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:w-full [&amp;&gt;:not(:has(table))]:max-w-[var(--article-max-width)]"><div class="text-ds-primary text-ds-body1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><div class="[&amp;_a:hover]:font-inherit [&amp;_a:hover]:underline [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_blockquote]:ps-ds-6 [&amp;_blockquote]:text-ds-body1 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:bg-ds-dimmed [&amp;_blockquote]:before:w-ds-2 [&amp;_blockquote]:relative [&amp;_blockquote]:before:absolute [&amp;_blockquote]:before:-inset-y-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:start-0 [&amp;_blockquote]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_em]:italic [&amp;_h1]:text-[2em] [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.55em] [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.33em] [&amp;_h4]:text-[1.11em] [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_*:not(span)+*:not(span)]:mt-[1em] [&amp;_p+ol]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_p+ul]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ol+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:break-words [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p>Spot rebates are a new maker fee incentive structure on a select number of lower-liquidity spot pairs.</p><p>Designed to <strong>improve market structure</strong> by stimulating passive liquidity, narrowing spreads, and enhancing overall book depth on recently underperforming pairs. Full fee schedule and eligible pair list are available <a target="_blank" href="https://support.kraken.com/articles/pairs-eligible-for-maker-fee-rebates">here</a>.</p><p>Your spot rebate fee tier is based on the <strong>best of</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>spot trading volume</strong></p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Assets on Platform (AoP)</strong></p></li></ul><p>The measure that qualifies you for the highest tier applies. Holding assets on Kraken can now qualify you for lower trading fees, the more you hold, the lower your rate could be. If more than one measure qualifies you for the same tier, your rates remain unchanged, qualifying through multiple measures at the same tier does not provide additional benefits.</p><p><sup>*Volume generated with Instant Buy does not count towards your 30 day volume incentives.</sup></p><p>Scroll table to the right to view percentages</p></div></div><div class="relative overflow-x-auto [&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_a]:no-underline hover:[&amp;_a]:underline"><table class="mobile-table w-full text-start"><thead class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700 min-h-[undefinedpx]"><tr class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700"><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Tier</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0"><span style="font-family:Arial">Spot 30-Day Vol (USD) </span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold">OR</span></span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">AoP (USD)</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Spot Maker (%)</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Spot Taker (%)</span></th></tr></thead><tbo