ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ol&gt;li+li]:mt-[.75em] [&amp;_ol&gt;li::marker]:font-bold [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_a]:text-ds-purple-500 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-ds-purple-700 [&amp;_a:hover]:underline group-[.theme-set]/theme:[&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_ul]:ps-[1.5em] [&amp;_ol]:ps-[1.7em]"><p>Kraken uses a maker-taker fee tier system with volume incentives based on your spot, margin and Futures volume, as well as your assets on platform (AoP) in the past 30 days.*</p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://support.kraken.com/articles/cross-platform-fee-tier-changes"><em>More information about cross-platform fee tiers</em></a></p><p>Volume on FX pairs and stablecoin order books does not contribute any volume-based discounts on Kraken Futures and vice versa.</p><p><em>*For Canada, US, and New Zealand customers, futures are not available or do not apply to cross-platform tier qualification.</em></p><span style="font-size:0.75em">Scroll table to the right to view percentages</span></div></div><div class="relative overflow-x-auto [&amp;_a]:text-ds-brand [&amp;_a]:no-underline hover:[&amp;_a]:underline"><table class="w-full text-start"><thead class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700 min-h-[undefinedpx]"><tr class="border-b border-solid border-ds-grey-700"><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Tier</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">Futures 30-Day Vol (USD) OR</span></th><th scope="col" class="py-ds-5 pe-ds-10 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis md:min-w-[148px] text-ds-primary align-top sticky top-0 text-start undefined"><span class="text-ds-primary text-ds-label1 ms-ds-0 me-ds-0 mt-ds-0 mb-ds-0">