_type":"paragraphAccordionItem","field_children":[{"_key":"6814b6f03048","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyLc","field_body":"\u003cp>This fee schedule applies to FX pairs (EUR/USD), stablecoins in the base currency (USDT/USD, DAI/USDT, etc.) and pegged tokens (TBTC/BTC, WBTC/BTC, etc.). If the stablecoin is the quote currency only (BTC/DAI), the fee schedule in the &quot;Spot Crypto&quot; tab applies.*\u003c/p>\n"},{"_key":"2a557a9739d5","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyLc","field_body":"\u003cp>With our competitive stablecoin fee structure, we aim to deliver deep liquidity, tight spreads and minimal slippage.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>For more information regarding stablecoin, pegged token &amp; FX pair fees, please see our&nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://support.kraken.com/hc/en-us/articles/360039299431-How-do-stablecoin-FX-fees-work-\">Support Center article.\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\n"},{"_key":"c97fa69fddd0","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyTable","field_rows":[{"_key":"ff6b92146418","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyTableRow","field_cells":[{"_key":"037443e1296a","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyTableCell","cell_description":"30- Day Volume (USD)","field_content":"\u003cp>30- Day Volume (USD)\u003c/p>\n"},{"_key":"a1814c007da3","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyTableCell","cell_description":"Maker","field_content":"\u003cp>Maker\u003c/p>\n"},{"_key":"646584f9bcde","_type":"paragraphArticleBodyTableCell","cell_description":"Taker","field_content":"\u003cp>Taker\u003c/p>\n"}],"row_description":"Row :: add here"},{"_key":"tUGtNnIkJ_BiDP6qreCKi","field_cells":[{"_key":"J8PggzKE8Ky3oMo0PUPFR","cell_description":"Content of Column 1","field_content":"$0 +"},{"_key":"u-klbRU41SiMxG1wqs1fi","cell_description":"Content of Column 2","field_content":"0.20%"},{"_key":"Qai9FbeRsMEzQzC1yRZ_0","cell_description":"Content of Column 3","field_content":"0.20%"}],"row_description":"Row :: $0 +"},{"_key":"OtIPaNTeMWATc7LQnQW0s","field_cells":[{"_key":"vR4PxYLkFqE1bWDzRB6q2","cell_description":"Content of Column 1","field_c