","fee_schedule][1be275c8d276][field_content":"≥ $400M","fee_schedule][384ce9842edc][field_content":"20m","fee_schedule][dfeaf59ebc51][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][799c2fd9a7ad][field_content":"\u003cp>0.09 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][150864939500][field_content":"Pro 2","fee_schedule][8dd2e92e2caf][field_content":"$100M+","fee_schedule][c11cbda3da91][field_content":"≥ $500M","fee_schedule][eeea4504ee3f][field_content":"25m","fee_schedule][a9a123449c78][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][ce493cdfe3ef][field_content":"\u003cp>0.08 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][c46cc4fccde8][field_content":"Pro 3","fee_schedule][bce34b79cff8][field_content":"$250M+","fee_schedule][3c203b87721e][field_content":"≥ $1B","fee_schedule][f5b602b558b9][field_content":"50m","fee_schedule][e7aaa2b05cd5][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][66f762ec4717][field_content":"\u003cp>0.07 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][de1cdc46bb7b][field_content":"Pro 4","fee_schedule][1f39dd335a5f][field_content":"$400M+","fee_schedule][b042bdf98f45][field_content":"≥ $2B","fee_schedule][f2f980aa4c5e][field_content":"80m","fee_schedule][2395bf94c14f][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][363b40af196b][field_content":"\u003cp>0.06 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][26b045967926][field_content":"Pro 5","fee_schedule][1c71d231de08][field_content":"$500M+","fee_schedule][e23070464722][field_content":"&gt;5B","fee_schedule][cc0f02c05ea5][field_content":"100m","fee_schedule][45d503255ac9][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][9b6243e424bb][field_content":"\u003cp>0.05 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][7271d59538a4][field_search_placeholder":"Search","fee_schedule][334243cbc40b][field_body":"\u003cp>Previously, your tier on each product was based solely on your trading volume in that product. Going forward, your tier is based on the \u003cstrong>best of\u003c/strong>:\u003c/p>\u003cul>\u003cli>\u003cp>Your \u003cstrong>spot trading volume\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>\u003c/li>\u003cli>\u003cp>Your \u003cstrong>Assets on Platform (AoP)\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\u003cp>The measure that qualifies you for the highest tier applies. Holding assets on Kraken can now qualify you for lower trading fees, the more you hold, the lower your rate could be. If more than one measure qualifies you for the same tier, your rates remain unchanged, qualifying through multiple measures at the same tier does not provide additional benefits.\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://support.kraken.com/articles/cross-platform-fee-tier-changes\">\u003cem>More information about cross-platform fee tiers\u003c/em>\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.75em;\">Scroll table to the right to view percentages\u003c/span>","fee_schedule][334243cbc40b][field_heading":"How your tier is determined","fee_schedule][4583256a5a76][field_content":"Tier","fee_schedule][245b8a31771f][field_content":"\u003cp>Spot 30-Day Vol (USD) \u003cstrong>OR\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][1eab1f281b4e][field_content":"AoP (USD)","fee_schedule][b3d0c45cbb7f][field_content":"\u003cp>Maker (%)\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][fbe23e2ef068][field_content":"\u003cp>Taker (%)\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][7c098271d1d4][field_content":"Tier 1","fee_schedule][14ea4b73b757][field_content":"$0+","fee_schedule][4ef704765a31][field_content":"N/A","fee_schedule][e918e93cabb4][field_content":"\u003cp>0.40 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][45adbb8298b2][field_content":"\u003cp>0.80 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][c81f7c2e1dff][field_content":"Tier 2","fee_schedule][287a345427d5][field_content":"$2.5K+","fee_schedule][4fbba9b8bff2][field_content":"N/A","fee_schedule][6417d5ae05dc][field_content":"\u003cp>0.30 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][591badd7a574][field_content":"\u003cp>0.60 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][60356465d4ae][field_content":"Tier 3","fee_schedule][4c035ca3a4a6][field_content":"$10K+","fee_schedule][2afd35338f8b][field_content":"20k","fee_schedule][95f2c26a5a9f][field_content":"\u003cp>0.22 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][ef37f62f719e][field_content":"\u003cp>0.38 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][6068017b7d2a][field_content":"Tier 4","fee_schedule][5d6888ead554][field_content":"$25K+","fee_schedule][b37b52a28d9d][field_content":"50k","fee_schedule][fc7924cafe8d][field_content":"\u003cp>0.20 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][2135e67a64f0][field_content":"\u003cp>0.35 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][fbe47cf82726][field_content":"Tier 5","fee_schedule][7233d65985f9][field_content":"$50K+","fee_schedule][523ddff65538][field_content":"100k","fee_schedule][7c37f98da8ce][field_content":"\u003cp>0.15 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][8530ef18a69c][field_content":"\u003cp>0.30 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][89c608453c78][field_content":"Tier 6","fee_schedule][f26edc20c5a2][field_content":"$100K+","fee_schedule][31aa8d89476f][field_content":"200k","fee_schedule][3a8dda8d98a6][field_content":"\u003cp>0.12 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][340d711f3375][field_content":"\u003cp>0.25 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][58ae42570fb3][field_content":"Tier 7","fee_schedule][2eddcf838d5c][field_content":"$250K+","fee_schedule][643205ac5341][field_content":"400k","fee_schedule][1ab4a0ba0294][field_content":"\u003cp>0.10 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][6bc4052010dc][field_content":"\u003cp>0.22 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][a47d5e242e50][field_content":"Tier 8","fee_schedule][7e337fc677e8][field_content":"$500K+","fee_schedule][6ed5e00f1f9d][field_content":"600k","fee_schedule][b94ab45f35c9][field_content":"\u003cp>0.08 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][7a72911f5235][field_content":"\u003cp>0.20 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][dbc235f13270][field_content":"Tier 9","fee_schedule][c73ffdec94da][field_content":"$1M+","fee_schedule][51f89129abb8][field_content":"1m","fee_schedule][0627c57bd81c][field_content":"\u003cp>0.06 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][36acaccd8dc2][field_content":"\u003cp>0.18 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][586fd0ca1612][field_content":"Tier 10","fee_schedule][