hedule][09376c0b69fe][field_content":"Pro 5","fee_schedule][92c631779f65][field_content":"$500M+","fee_schedule][4475c3d38f67][field_content":"100m","fee_schedule][e9d94645bb8d][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][65152cf3714c][field_content":"\u003cp>0.05 %\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][525fdc8edfc3][field_search_placeholder":"Search","fee_schedule][2fb567ed473d][field_title":"Cross-platform Fee Tiers","fee_schedule][ef81146a36d5][field_body":"\u003cp>Kraken uses a maker-taker fee schedule with volume incentives based on your activity in the past 30 days.*  \u003c/p>\u003cp>Our fee schedules are built to encourage traders to engage with the market and to drive maximum liquidity.  \u003c/p>\u003cp>Certain services, including Telegram chat trading, use request-for-quote pricing. For these trades, the quoted price is all-inclusive and already reflects Kraken's spread and fees.\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003csup>*Volume generated with Instant Buy does not count towards your 30 day volume incentives.\u003c/sup>\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][46hjb_xdhln0lm6nekpda][field_content":"30- Day Volume (USD)","fee_schedule][6kzuwlm8_6idisod6_ef-][field_content":"Maker","fee_schedule][ho2zqjjnehc6bpqbuz62e][field_content":"Taker","fee_schedule][odiiqgle0o0cb-nwt3ipi][field_content":"$0 +","fee_schedule][8tqumoe7nkgpwthcxhgs9][field_content":"0.40%","fee_schedule][qmqwznc59r39bksupegim][field_content":"0.80%","fee_schedule][zdlerg1ra4b6403i2c6j-][field_content":"$2,500 +","fee_schedule][p-cfrnh4wk0jztuqahzuu][field_content":"0.30%","fee_schedule][dcx4uqbvatt4jjtg5kvor][field_content":"0.60%","fee_schedule][76kclm-ps1n1rib31k2yt][field_content":"$10,000 +","fee_schedule][h-j4zgm735fqzfiqfvnqe][field_content":"0.22%","fee_schedule][86tu6yahjm8v6noy7xhvy][field_content":"0.38%","fee_schedule][z8cgtycxx6zpwrzoypbdu][field_content":"$25,000 +","fee_schedule][uqk7fqdgqdmltonu3olxp][field_content":"0.20%","fee_schedule][06es7-yi4_xidhtckdhc6][field_content":"0.35%","fee_schedule][frv-gng