ee_schedule][05afa3e595af][field_title":"Spot Crypto","fee_schedule][2905a972c70f][field_body":"\u003cp>Spot rebates are a new maker fee incentive structure on a select number of lower-liquidity spot pairs.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Designed to \u003cstrong>improve market structure\u003c/strong> by stimulating passive liquidity, narrowing spreads, and enhancing overall book depth on recently underperforming pairs. Full fee schedule and eligible pair list are available \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://support.kraken.com/articles/pairs-eligible-for-maker-fee-rebates\">here\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Your spot rebate fee tier is based on the \u003cstrong>best of\u003c/strong>:\u003c/p>\u003cul>\u003cli>\u003cp>Your \u003cstrong>spot trading volume\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>\u003c/li>\u003cli>\u003cp>Your \u003cstrong>Assets on Platform (AoP)\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\u003cp>The measure that qualifies you for the highest tier applies. Holding assets on Kraken can now qualify you for lower trading fees, the more you hold, the lower your rate could be. If more than one measure qualifies you for the same tier, your rates remain unchanged, qualifying through multiple measures at the same tier does not provide additional benefits.\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003csup>*Volume generated with Instant Buy does not count towards your 30 day volume incentives.\u003c/sup>\u003c/p>\u003cp>Scroll table to the right to view percentages\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][iiie3vdptsgwqps67-jyi][field_content":"Tier","fee_schedule][xpqgwtygw9kssglduxjdu][field_content":"\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Spot 30-Day Vol (USD) \u003c/span>\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\">OR\u003c/span>","fee_schedule][iz3xqtoaexwtrulkh0umr][field_content":"AoP (USD)","fee_schedule][pqm--lwryxg9ymdfa0ogw][field_content":"Spot Maker (%)","fee_schedule][vt5ux2cqx6ejoe28xgwsb][field_content":"Spot Taker (%)","fee_schedule][q_p3njti_gltocpxhdyhy][field_con