$1B","fee_schedule][8ff730f5c44a][field_content":"50m","fee_schedule][cbb2b270317b][field_content":"-0.02%","fee_schedule][oq2h8m7dewzwz0-8ljxe6][field_content":"0.07%","fee_schedule][fecc0b6c072f][field_content":"Pro 4","fee_schedule][ec4cc254cd42][field_content":"$400M+","fee_schedule][e35bbf317d35][field_content":"≥ $2B","fee_schedule][2429f9f89e46][field_content":"80m","fee_schedule][4e1a8ec12c02][field_content":"-0.02%","fee_schedule][nwamnfl_cto1gcnf5u8dk][field_content":"0.06%","fee_schedule][41a8cabb8545][field_content":"Pro 5","fee_schedule][850f2ed4354d][field_content":"$500M+","fee_schedule][0f443395fad6][field_content":"&gt;5B","fee_schedule][c5b4a171ed1d][field_content":"100m","fee_schedule][7e3e31657fb6][field_content":"-0.02%","fee_schedule][e0ofd5yathcdirgegwnuj][field_content":"0.05%","fee_schedule][45158e9567c8][field_search_placeholder":"Search","fee_schedule][2654c355a229][field_body":"\u003cp>Spot rebates are a new maker fee incentive structure on a select number of lower-liquidity spot pairs.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Designed to \u003cstrong>improve market structure\u003c/strong> by stimulating passive liquidity, narrowing spreads, and enhancing overall book depth on recently underperforming pairs. Full fee schedule and eligible pair list are available \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://support.kraken.com/articles/pairs-eligible-for-maker-fee-rebates\">here\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003csup>*Volume generated with Instant Buy does not count towards your 30 day volume incentives.\u003c/sup>\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][0051aa0a26bb][field_content":"30- Day Volume (USD)","fee_schedule][e554ae224dc5][field_content":"Maker","fee_schedule][8e448604c1b3][field_content":"Taker","fee_schedule][ff4a3fa427a7][field_content":"$0 +","fee_schedule][6e1bd6b959ae][field_content":"0.23%","fee_schedule][fb647414779a][field_content":"0.40%","fee_schedule][70aed8061d52][field_content":"$10,000 +","fee_schedule][d7360a01b8c7][field_content":"0.18%","fee_schedule][178de95494a1][field_content":"0.35%","fee_schedule][5d125e67d9f0][field_content":"$50,000 +","fee_schedule][5c9f5e174c36][field_content":"0.12%","fee_schedule][910caa88681e][field_content":"0.24%","fee_schedule][d07f074f9d79][field_content":"$100,000 +","fee_schedule][e3cfdea70343][field_content":"0.10%","fee_schedule][7ce9e3f26a3a][field_content":"0.22%","fee_schedule][ed60e430e8c2][field_content":"$250,000 +","fee_schedule][3530d5b30de8][field_content":"0.08%","fee_schedule][519fb0709d6c][field_content":"0.20%","fee_schedule][3e36a24aa1d9][field_content":"$500,000 +","fee_schedule][47a48c3783b0][field_content":"0.06%","fee_schedule][f3ba69597f5f][field_content":"0.18%","fee_schedule][fb792f6eea4f][field_content":"$1,000,000 +","fee_schedule][36bc4c6bf918][field_content":"0.04%","fee_schedule][44e893631c67][field_content":"0.16%","fee_schedule][47e8a350797b][field_content":"$2,500,000 +","fee_schedule][2b399c311286][field_content":"0.02%","fee_schedule][eb3418f7b569][field_content":"0.14%","fee_schedule][3e11ce947a16][field_content":"$5,000,000 +","fee_schedule][981ed9cac9b2][field_content":"0.00%","fee_schedule][7d10bfe8ecc5][field_content":"0.12%","fee_schedule][fd98b5284510][field_content":"$10,000,000 +","fee_schedule][e8b39b5198bb][field_content":"-0.02%","fee_schedule][92d05875d029][field_content":"0.10%","fee_schedule][03dec71344b6][field_content":"$100,000,000 +","fee_schedule][3d27fdca8c95][field_content":"-0.02%","fee_schedule][a73a41b9c319][field_content":"0.08%","fee_schedule][4fb5a78a6ff0][field_content":"$500,000,000 +","fee_schedule][f58cf3d37d0f][field_content":"-0.02%","fee_schedule][ec6c2902690e][field_content":"0.05%","fee_schedule][a376106b77c2][field_search_placeholder":"Search","fee_schedule][07cb9d6461e4][field_title":"Spot Maker Rebate","fee_schedule][6814b6f03048][field_body":"\u003cp>This fee schedule applies to FX pairs (EUR/USD), stablecoins in the base currency (USDT/USD, DAI/USDT, etc.) and pegged tokens (TBTC/BTC, WBTC/BTC, etc.). If the stablecoin is the quote currency only (BTC/DAI), the fee schedule in the &quot;Spot Crypto&quot; tab applies.*\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][2a557a9739d5][field_body":"\u003cp>With our competitive stablecoin fee structure, we aim to deliver deep liquidity, tight spreads and minimal slippage.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>For more information regarding stablecoin, pegged token &amp; FX pair fees, please see our&nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://support.kraken.com/hc/en-us/articles/360039299431-How-do-stablecoin-FX-fees-work-\">Support Center article.\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][037443e1296a][field_content":"\u003cp>30- Day Volume (USD)\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][a1814c007da3][field_content":"\u003cp>Maker\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][646584f9bcde][field_content":"\u003cp>Taker\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][j8pggzke8ky3omo0pupfr][field_content":"$0 +","fee_schedule][u-klbru41simxg1wqs1fi][field_content":"0.20%","fee_schedule][qai9fbersmezqzc1yrz_0][field_content":"0.20%","fee_schedule][vr4pxylkfqe1bwdzrb6q2][field_content":"$50,000 +","fee_schedule][xw-slx1msxwrw1_mjod_t][field_content":"0.16%","fee_schedule][fdwszunrubezj8_a3roxe][field_content":"0.16%","fee_schedule][2klr8yk1bshh2v_bv4vla][field_content":"$100,000 +","fee_schedule][yuq9go102hy3j16771fuv][field_content":"0.12%","fee_schedule][pmaiun4upxnyfauisbqtg][field_content":"0.12%","fee_schedule][bwxjc19eim_hhomoaafwn][field_content":"$250,000 +","fee_schedule][0vxbdvrbcnhscbfzne-yq][field_content":"0.08%","fee_schedule][xkfz5vtru-r-ugj3yqgtt][field_content":"0.08%","fee_schedule][-gcjdsaqnznxvyqjkhi1s][field_content":"$500,000 +","fee_schedule][7eihy3l7e2sv0sezr9pqk][field_content":"0.04%","fee_schedule][e7jsvdwwblr-xpnus2g7h][field_content":"0.04%","fee_schedule][hz4zllpe7e9rano3aqcg-][field_content":"$1,000,000 +","fee_schedule][ozq8trpxdlxz2dol9kkcq][field_content":"0.02%","fee_schedule][pbwtyptdg4jfln4fgbnnj][field_content":"0.02%","fee_schedule][fx8h9zsmecupwimabeu18][field_content":"$10,000,000 +","fee_schedule][6z-cigrd5tnoibbefrqvk][field_content":"0.00%","fee_schedule][w0qhks8wljyum381d7swl][field_content":"0.01%","fee_schedule][9hdp0wtuhvat_8u-alekm][field_content":"$100,000,000 +","fee_schedule][60tief9pi7w2t_mdgp6ez][field_content":"0.00%","fee_schedule][zel6kmqzakl3xmwpshmck][field_content":"0.001%","fee_schedule][50bcd2b6ab95][field_body":"\u003cp>\u003csup>*Fee schedule volume-based discounts are based on crypto trading volume only. Making purchases using the Buy Crypto widget, Kraken app as well as trading stablecoin and FX pairs on our order books does not contribute to the fee schedule 30-day volume.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;\u003c/sup>\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][3c25162a90fd][field_title":"Stablecoin, Pegged Token & FX Pairs","fee_schedule][d23e340e65e3][field_body":"\u003cp>The USDG fee schedule aims to make USDG a compelling and efficient stablecoin within the Kraken ecosystem &mdash; promoting deep liquidity, tighter spreads, and minimal trading costs.\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][ae680c179682][field_body":"\u003cp>\u003csup>This fee schedule applies only to pairs where USDG is the base currency (for example: USDG/USD)\u003c/sup>\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][754a43aa03e0][field_content":"\u003cp>30- Day Volume (USD)\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][e7265d7e8cf3][field_content":"\u003cp>Maker\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][98af6946e2e2][field_content":"\u003cp>Taker\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][48dc6542f8da][field_content":"$0 +","fee_schedule][3f4927502b37][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0%\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][9f77ec9b3fea][field_content":"\u003cp>0.01%\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][e86f1400873c][field_content":"$100,000,000 + **","fee_schedule][0b675f29bb3e][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0%\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][820ff1887497][field_content":"\u003cp>0.001%\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][6a01f3b3e6a1][field_title":"USDG Pairs","fee_schedule][cda5e14c6952][field_body":"\u003cp>The USDe schedule applies to orderbook USDe pairs which will be part of this 0 fee campaign until the 30th June, 2026\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][6389e42a2ac6][field_content":"\u003cp>30- Day Volume (USD)\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][d5c7abbbbaca][field_content":"\u003cp>Maker\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][adb28ef1483d][field_content":"\u003cp>Taker\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][a30712fb63aa][field_content":"$0 +","fee_schedule][7c1f6c2aec3b][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0%\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][f97de8b84005][field_content":"\u003cp>0.0%\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][36aa0e0c3cce][field_title":"USDe Pairs","fee_schedule][33428e2a7230][field_body":"\u003cp>All margin fees are applied in addition to volume based trading fees at the opening and closing of margin positions.\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][faa1387cc1ff][field_body":"\u003cp>Margin rates fluctuate based on market conditions, but your rollover rate will be locked in at the time of order execution. This rate will be displayed on the order form as you fill out your order.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Eligible clients are able to maintain open spot positions on margin for an unlimited duration, as long as margin requirements are met.\u003c/p>\u003cp>• \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://support.kraken.com/hc/en-us/articles/227876608-Margin-trading-pairs-and-their-maximum-leverage\">See leverage available for all pairs.\u003c/a>\u003cbr>• \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://support.kraken.com/hc/en-us/articles/209238787-Margin-borrow-limits\">See margin allowance limits.\u003c/a>\u003cbr>• \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://support.kraken.com/hc/en-us/articles/206161568-What-are-the-fees-opening-and-rollover-for-trading-using-margin-\">See margin trading fees\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\u003cp>Additionally,Kraken may liquidate positions automatically at the current index price of the market, immediately closing the position and realizing any associated losses. \u003cbr>\u003c/p>\u003cp>This process includes a 2% liquidation fee as a way to manage risk associated with that market and prevent further losses due to slippage. As these orders do not go through the order book, they do not incur the standard trading fee.\u003c/p>","fee_schedule][e95931810526][field_content":"\u003cp>Currency\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][bbbcb4c17e3a][field_content":"\u003cp>Opening fee\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][96ae2db12cbd][field_content":"\u003cp>Rollover fee\u003c/p>\n","fee_schedule][e-to__szlejjsmqu-h-og][field_content":"Ox (ZRX)","fee_schedule][nwxuiiu-w_ehpmwmbpbim][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][5pgc7se8l17zhb1imhq7f][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule][dbob7uyavhsqrqvo98xon][field_content":"Aave (AAVE)","fee_schedule][mjbo2ane-yzcyj9xmvjmd][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][df-aeqocf0kcg_psgy0jb][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule][mbwl3l8bdg7bcp7lkf9hz][field_content":"Algorand (ALGO)","fee_schedule][t9xehfe7gruvaodnlrt1o][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][j7vyoyfkasvx2uwctalt3][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule][99zu55rh9ckvxonp3kvpr][field_content":"ApeCoin (APE)","fee_schedule][fn9wgzu5kseww_ic5fofo][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][ov5coepfdo-kkhbssdgfj][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule][jlmjrgud4z6wns-lafubo][field_content":"Aptos (APT)","fee_schedule][ryzxxksikqks0n00stkgv][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][glhklzeyljera-ef1_lmy][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule][tkeh8j3pchahc7jw2jf2a][field_content":"Arbitrum (ARB)","fee_schedule][prw0i-engqvf7umn5_j5p][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][mfiagypqsv8cch9oymlpu][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule][lid9j9el1qh5qqkpe-gyj][field_content":"Australian Dollar (AUD)","fee_schedule][alqqqlexuo3kzcr6jgjrt][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04%","fee_schedule][go-ofb-vxarqdjgvvil2c][field_content":"0.02% - 0.04% per 4 hours","fee_schedule]